cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and cite the original publisher of any figure you use."
type: dataset
title: "AI Environmental Disclosure Scorecard"
abstract: >
  What ten AI developers (Google, OpenAI, Microsoft, Meta, Amazon, Apple, Anthropic, xAI, DeepSeek,
  Mistral AI) publish about the environmental footprint of their AI: energy, water and carbon per
  prompt, per image or video, company-wide emissions, and data center PUE and WUE. One row per
  developer and indicator, with status (measured, stated, modelled, published or not found), value
  as published, source URL and retrieval date.
